{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52312","headline":"诗（幷序） 七十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 七十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"运命随身搏（张改作「缚」，袁谓不错，戴校「转」），人生不自觉。\n业厚即福来，业强（项疑「薄」之讹）福不着。\n淳善皆安稳，蛊害总煞却。\n身作身自当，将头来自斫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}